<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>You already have a Velexis account</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Someone tried to create a Velexis account with this e-mail address. You already have an account, so no new account was created.</p>
    <p>To use your account, sign in at <a href="{{portalUrl}}">{{portalUrl}}</a>. If you forgot your password, choose a new one:</p>
    <p><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #1d4ed8; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Choose a new password</a></p>
    <p style="color: #52606d; font-size: 13px;">If the button does not work, open this link: <a href="{{resetUrl}}">{{resetUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The link is valid for 1 hour. If this was not you, you can ignore this e-mail: your account has not changed.</p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
